#: data/org.gnome.Resources.metainfo.xml.in.in:17
msgid ""
"Resources allows you to check the utilization of your system resources and control your running processes and apps. It’s designed to be user-friendly and feel right at home on a modern desktop by using GNOME’s "
"libadwaita."
msgstr ""
"Resorsas vos permet de verificar l'utilizacion de las resorsas de vòstre sistèma e de contrarotlar vòstres processus e aplicacions en cors. Es concebut per èsser convivial e per s'integrar naturalament a un burèu "
"modèrne en utilizant libadwaita de GNOME."

